  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of IOM Activities in T&#xFC;rkiye as Outlined in the 2023 Syria Regional Refugee Response Plan (3RP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activities for this project are in line with the strategic direction of the Regional Refugee and Resilience Plan (3RP) for 2023-2025 and aims to develop a strong protection network, strengthen, and deepen the resilience approach, enhance self-reliance through economic opportunities, and contribute to a durable solution for refugees by supporting their inclusion into Turkish society.</narrative>
  </description>
